## 📋 24. Day 10 — Model Selection & Inference Playbook (`ticket_classifier/playbook.py`)

Day 10 introduces the **Inference Control Playbook v1.1** natively into the `ticket_classifier` pipeline. The playbook maps task categories directly to recommended production models, sampling temperature, and top-p hyperparameters.

### Production Request Flow Architecture

```text
Incoming Ticket
       │
       ▼
