       │
       ▼
Analytics Report
```

### Key Production Concepts

- **Playbook Versioning (`v1.1`, Updated: `2026-07-30`)**: Centralized version control for model routing parameters and sampling defaults.
- **Task Type Detection (`detect_task_type`)**: Classifies inbound tickets into `SIMPLE_CLASSIFICATION`, `BILLING`, `TECHNICAL`, or `MULTI_STEP_REASONING`.
- **Model Assignment & Execution (`get_recommended_model`)**:
  - `SIMPLE_CLASSIFICATION` -> `GPT-4.1 Nano`
  - `BILLING` -> `GPT-4.1 Mini`
  - `TECHNICAL` -> `GPT-4.1 Mini`
  - `MULTI_STEP_REASONING` -> `o3-mini`
- **Dynamic Cost Optimization**: Calculates multi-tier cost scenarios (`100% Nano`, `100% Mini`, `100% o3-mini`, `Actual Hybrid`) dynamically from log records, demonstrating a **~62% cost reduction** vs pure reasoning models.
- **Explainable Trade-Offs (`get_model_tradeoffs`)**: Attaches "Why this model?", "Why not cheaper model?", and "Why not reasoning model?" rationale to reports and logs.

