### Day 15 Requirement Mapping Table

| Requirement | Implemented Using | Notes / Rationale |
|-------------|-------------------|-------------------|
| **Prompt Management** | Langfuse | Centralized prompt template storage in Langfuse UI |
| **Prompt Versioning** | Langfuse | Immutable version history (v1, v2) with commit messages in Langfuse |
| **Prompt Registry** | Langfuse | SDK prompt retrieval by name, version, or `production` label (`langfuse.get_prompt()`) |
| **Prompt Version Logging** | Langfuse + Python | Python SDK initializes `langfuse.trace()` and `trace.generation(prompt=...)` linking trace telemetry directly to prompt versions |
| **Rollback** | Langfuse | Zero-code instant rollback achieved by re-assigning the `production` label in Langfuse UI |
| **Canary Release** | Langfuse + Python | 90/10 traffic routing in Python script while logging each arm to Langfuse Traces |
| **Template Safety** | Langfuse | Safe variable binding using `prompt.compile(ticket=...)` avoiding string concatenation |
| **Reproducibility** | Langfuse + Python | Fixed prompt version + deterministic parameters (Temperature=0, model specs) |

